to where my strategy is.

00:04:41.862 --> 00:04:44.751
That's an interesting
insight I care less about

00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:47.880
the perception of having 20,
50, 100,000 views on Youtube

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.299
