essence of who I am.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:20.421
It's a good first look, it's a
good first impression for me.

00:05:20.421 --> 00:05:21.462
It's also very well produced.

00:05:21.462 --> 00:05:24.038
I'm interested in people seeing it.

00:05:24.038 --> 00:05:26.938
And right now, Facebook
feels like the right place

00:05:26.938 --> 00:05:29.789
