what I don't understand.

00:05:51.949 --> 00:05:55.481
You know what you're getting
from Youtube from last decade.

00:05:55.481 --> 00:05:58.350
By not tasting what Facebook
could be bringing to you

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:01.992
